    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2455/26 - 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0db4\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd0\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc3 25 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db6\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u0dad\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dca\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.09.25\n\nNo. 2455/26 \u2013 THURSDAY, SEPTEMBER 25, 2025 - 25.09.2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority) PART III \u2014 LANDS Land Acquisition Notices\n\n1A - G 045442 - 19 (09/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) Notice under Section 7 My Ref. No. : HL/3/2/1/28. Tourism and Lands Ministry's Ref. No. : 03J/92/ FR/65. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose. Description of the land/servitude to be acquired : An Allotment of land in total extent of about 8.1300 Hectares depicted as Lot No. 1AF in the Topo P. P. No. 46, Inset 7 dated 03.02.2021 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village called Diyamigolla in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 154A of Kolongasthenna in Kandapalla Korale Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Haldummulla in Badulla District of Uva Province and described as follows: Lot No. 1 AF Name of land: Eriyakatiya Kale; Description: Forest; Claimant: Amarasinghe Arachchige Don Hemapala Amarasinghe, Resident of No. 404, Rajamalwaththa, Moratuwa; Extent: 8.1300 Hectares."
