    "chunk_text": "w;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2456$37 - 2025 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 01 jeks nodod - 2025.10'01No. 2456/37 - WEDNESDAY, OCTOBER 01, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\n1A - PG 7270 - 64 (10/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nMEDIATION BOARDS COMMISSION\n\nNotice Calling for Nominations for the Appointment of Mediators\n\nTHE Mediation Boards Commission, by virtue of the powers vested in it by Section 4(1) of the Mediation (Special Categories of Disputes) Act, No. 21 of 2003, invites nominations for the appointment of Chairman and Mediators in respect of resolving all disputes relating to State Lands and Private Lands subject to the provisions contained in the Extraordinary Gazette Notification No. 2261/68 dated 06.01.2022 for the following Panel of Special Mediation Board who is to vacate post in terms of sections 1 to 5 in the Schedule of the Mediation (Special Categories of Disputes) Act No. 21 of 2003.\n\nAdministrative District Special Mediation Board Areas Date of Vacation of PostMulathivu Mulathivu District 01.03.2023Ampara Ampara District 01.03.2023Colombo Colombo District 01.10.2025 Rathnapura Rathnapura District 01.10.2025Kurunegala Kurunegala District 01.10.2025 Polonnaruwa Polonnaruwa District 01.10.2025 02. The Mediation Boards Commission hereby gives notice calling nominations upon (A) the Individuals, (B) the Bodies, Organizations and Institutions of non political nature, and (C) the District Secretaries/ Divisional Secretaries specified hereinafter under 02 (II) to submit names of person who are eligible under 02 (I) for appointment as Mediators to the Panel of Mediators for the said Special Mediation Board area:"
